{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the <i><strong>Float Your Goat</strong></i> demo, journey across the seas over hand designed puzzles while helping the goat and his \u201cfriends\u201d stay dry. Build increasingly elaborate rafts and test your problem solving skills with realistic buoyancy physics that can lead to the goats peril. Construct rafts using different materials with unique features to battle various environmental elements.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Infinite Possibilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level can be completed in countless ways, have endless fun exploring multiple solutions and constructions for every step of the way. Build them reliably and sturdily or risk it all with goofy solutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139630/extras/a832b89f1338995610cffc8f30c678df.poster.avif?t=1762953398\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139630/extras/a832b89f1338995610cffc8f30c678df.webm?t=1762953398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139630/extras/a832b89f1338995610cffc8f30c678df.mp4?t=1762953398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wacky rafts lead to wacky accidents</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goat is by no means indestructible. He can be crushed, drowned, flung and whacked and so can his \u201ccompanions\u201d. Be sure to check how much trauma you\u2019ve caused at the end of each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139630/extras/5b3ecfd29dd5b0b7f3cfe98b23e0c410.poster.avif?t=1762953398\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139630/extras/5b3ecfd29dd5b0b7f3cfe98b23e0c410.webm?t=1762953398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139630/extras/5b3ecfd29dd5b0b7f3cfe98b23e0c410.mp4?t=1762953398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the seas</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sail across hand drawn environments with wildlife thats inspired by different locations across the world. Begin your journey at Rocky Start surrounded by rugged islands and shrubland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139630/extras/60b26e806b67e9f85892306c5e87b378.poster.avif?t=1762953398\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139630/extras/60b26e806b67e9f85892306c5e87b378.webm?t=1762953398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139630/extras/60b26e806b67e9f85892306c5e87b378.mp4?t=1762953398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo Content:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself with a total of 12 unique handmade levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and play all of Rocky Start, the first of 4 areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master 2 of the most important materials in the game.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect your goat and his friend from the elements.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discord!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be sure to join our discord to keep up to date with development or discuss the game, the link can be found in the lower right hand corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4139630?t=1762953398","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4139630?t=1762953398","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139630/4c7fb581d922bf18849a33343e1a5a121021e09f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762953398","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139630/4c7fb581d922bf18849a33343e1a5a121021e09f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762953398","categories":[{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the <i><strong>Float Your Goat</strong></i> demo, journey across the seas over hand designed puzzles while helping the goat and his \u201cfriends\u201d stay dry. Build increasingly elaborate rafts and test your problem solving skills with realistic buoyancy physics that can lead to the goats peril. Construct rafts using different materials with unique features to battle various environmental elements.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Infinite Possibilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level can be completed in countless ways, have endless fun exploring multiple solutions and constructions for every step of the way. Build them reliably and sturdily or risk it all with goofy solutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139630/extras/a832b89f1338995610cffc8f30c678df.poster.avif?t=1762953398\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"ht