60b26e806b67e9f85892306c5e87b378.webm?t=1762953398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139630/extras/60b26e806b67e9f85892306c5e87b378.mp4?t=1762953398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo Content:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself with a total of 12 unique handmade levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and play all of Rocky Start, the first of 4 areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master 2 of the most important materials in the game.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect your goat and his friend from the elements.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discord!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be sure to join our discord to keep up to date with development or discuss the game, the link can be found in the lower right hand corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","developers":["Dawa Studios"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2932600","name":"Float Your Goat"},"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139630/a2ed82255b4d882215f3f8742a0c7b71f16f23cf/header.jpg?t=1762953398","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4139630/123440682/d3ad61e250d63174a2df63fe10a683f0cd4742ea/1762769119/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762769416","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4139630/123440682/d3ad61e250d63174a2df63fe10a683f0cd47